  m_Name: unit_820798
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  unitName: "Sei\xF0kona Aoife"
  unitId: 820798
  unitNumber: 8607
  description: "In the strange, cold North of an era long past, it was said that
    on lonely nights along the shores, a comely maiden dressed in sealskin would
    be seated upon a jutting rock, her sonorous melody carried upon the ocean-breeze.
    So heartfelt were her songs that many waded into the freezing waters, compelled
    by overwhelming desire.Known as the Maiden of Eyinhel, Aoife thrived on the souls
    of lovesick humans\u2014the more enraptured they were, the more delectable they
    became. Though aspects of her bewitching appearance hinted at her true demonic
    nature, so deeply infatuated were some that they persisted until they failed
    to return.Thus she passed her days sated but monotonous, until the day a desperate
    human had sought a premature end to a life of woe. Out of sheer amusement, Aoife
    entertained their delusions with dulcet promises of false everafters, and soon
    an unwitting pact was formed. Surely this deluded soul would be a splendid delicacy
    given enough time...As the months passed, however, Aoife failed to realize she'd
    fallen for her own trap\u2014fallen for the Pactbound's renewed love of life.Desperate
    to protect this illusion of normalcy, Aoife concealed the truth of her sustenance.
    But demons cannot survive on the farce known as love; Aoife found her spirit
    wasting by the day, and a hunger frenzy drove her to her limits. Scant memories
    remain... save for the day Aoife found her Pactbound lifeless, torn asunder by
    demonic claws.Little more is known of the lost island of Eyinhel and its illusory
    shores. Cast into the mists of the Void, the Queen in Cobalt watches silently
    as the seal-maiden gazes out over her sea of lost souls, singing for ghosts long
    gone."
  summonDesc: Another comes...<br>I sing only for the ghosts, now.<br>Yet, you listen...
  fusionDesc: You remind me of...<br>...<br>I apologize. Pay me no mind.
  evoDesc: Now there shall be vengeance;<br>as many dead as can link hands<br>around
    my shores!
  element: 2
  rarity: 7
